   "locked": false,
   "text": "RISK TO SETTLE FIRST\nA 70-500ms network call on a keystroke listener. If debouncing and\ncancellation do not hold, the IDE feels laggy and criterion 2 is gone.\nTime 20 real calls before committing to this.",
